// Fury / Explosion Spirits (EFST 86) persistent crackle, looped for the buff
// duration: short red lightning arcs (native elec_y_03.bmp, black-backed) snap
// on and off around the upper body one after another over a faint red pulse.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the unit's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. The body spans about y 191..291.
